moonlight-common-c: the GameStream protocol engine Latch's viewer links
(RTSP handshake, control and input channels, RTP video/audio reassembly with
FEC). crates/stream/build.rs compiles the files listed in its SOURCES array
and nothing else. GPL-3.0-or-later (LICENSE.txt); ENet and nanors keep their
own MIT licences (enet/LICENSE, nanors/LICENSE).

